{"hw":"ἐπίφθονος","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">ἐπίφθονος</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">ἐπίφθον-ος</span>, <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">ον</span>, <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">liable to envy</b> or <b class=\"lex-tr\">jealousy, looked on with jealousy, odious,</b> <span class=\"gk\">αἱ λίην ἰσχυραὶ τιμωρίαι πρὸς θεῶν ἐ. γίνονται</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">4.205</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">γνώμη πρὸς ἀνθρώπων ἐ.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">7.139</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">μηδ'..ἐ. πόρον τίθει</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">A.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ag.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">921</span> </span>; <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">τινι</span> by one, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">E.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Med.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">303</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Supp.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">893</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">εἴ τῳ θεῶν ἐ. ἐστρατεύσαμεν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Th.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">7.77</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">[πενία] ἥκιστα ἐ.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">X.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Smp.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">3.9</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">-ώτεραι</span> (sc. <span class=\"gk\">αἱ ἐμαὶ διατριβαί</span>) <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ap.</cite> </span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">37d</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">R.</cite> <sp